cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Master Time Series Analysis and Forecasting with Python — Course Notebooks
message: >-
  If you use these notebooks in your work or teaching, please cite them
  and link back to the course.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Diogo
    family-names: Alves de Resende
    affiliation: The Data Hero
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/diogoalvesderesende/time-series-forecasting-python
url: https://www.udemy.com/course/forecasting-python/
abstract: >-
  Companion notebooks for the Udemy course "Master Time Series Analysis and
  Forecasting with Python". Covers exponential smoothing and Holt-Winters,
  ARIMA, SARIMA and SARIMAX, Prophet, intermittent demand, LinkedIn
  Silverkite, LSTM, Temporal Fusion Transformers, N-BEATS, Amazon Chronos and
  Chronos 2, Amazon AutoGluon, Google TSMixer, and InceptionTime for time
  series classification. Includes starter files, completed notebooks,
  capstone projects and datasets.
keywords:
  - time series
  - forecasting
  - python
  - demand forecasting
  - ARIMA
  - SARIMAX
  - Prophet
  - Holt-Winters
  - LSTM
  - Temporal Fusion Transformer
  - N-BEATS
  - Amazon Chronos
  - AutoGluon
  - TSMixer
  - Darts
  - foundation models
  - machine learning
